silm:instances_papers_04_forge_sections_05_philosophical_substrate_concrete_anchor_2 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 05_philosophical_substrate #2', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Philosophical Substrate of the Forge' the bare symbol ValidationShape anchors to MittensVetRecordDependsOnCitationKey: The dependency arrow: the published claim depends on the citation key, which depends on the source-boundary declaration; reversing this would create a cycle and break acyclicity.." .
